  p("U5","5.6","Newton's Second Law in Rotational Form","2.D","What angular acceleration does the Rotating Platform model predict for a 2.0 N*m net torque?","5.0 rad/s^2",["0.80 rad/s^2","2.0 rad/s^2","8.0 rad/s^2"],"The inferred inertia is 0.40 kg·m², so α = τ/I = 2.0/0.40 = 5.0 rad/s². This also extends the table's linear pattern.",{stimulusGroupId:"phys1-torque-table",stimulus:torqueData});
