  p("U7","7.2","Frequency and Period of SHM","2.B","What are the period and frequency in the Spring Oscillation Samples?","2.0 s and 0.50 Hz",["0.50 s and 2.0 Hz","1.0 s and 1.0 Hz","4.0 s and 0.25 Hz"],"The oscillator returns to the same extreme position after 2.0 s, so T = 2.0 s. Frequency is f = 1/T = 0.50 Hz.",{stimulusGroupId:"phys1-oscillation-table",stimulus:oscillationData});
